meta {
  name: Get the ticket the last incident on the same monitor had
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/finding-tickets/last-time
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  For the incident you name in `incident`, the newest tracker ticket an earlier incident on the same monitor (else the same server) had in the last 90 days, so the same problem is not filed twice. `ticket` has the same fields as a finding’s ticket; `about` says what the incidents share (`monitor`, `server` or `subject`), with that earlier incident’s id and when it started. `data` is null when no earlier incident had a ticket, or that ticket is already linked to this incident. Read from what InfraNest recorded; nothing is asked of the tracker.

  Scope: `monitoring.read`
}
